":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-17T19:53:33Z","updated_at":"2026-07-23T03:07:07Z","closed_at":"2026-07-22T18:53:44Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121512","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121512","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121512.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121512.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-22T18:53:44Z"},"body":"This is a continuation of a recent [PR](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120715) which enables to transform booleans to scalar in a shader language. \r\nFirst, I've makes the operators been treated like a constant statement, so this code will compile correctly now:\r\n\r\n```gdshader\r\nvoid fragment() {\r\n\tvec3 v = vec3(1 == 1);\r\n\r\n\t// or\r\n\r\n\tvec3 v2 = vec3(true ? 1 : 0);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI've also found that a conversion between boolean scalar is allowed only in built-in type constructors (in GLSL). \r\nRead also: https://github.khronos.org/Vulkan-Site/glsl/latest/chapters/operators.html#constructors\r\nSo after this PR got merged user allowed to use boolean conversion only in cases like that:\r\n\r\n```gdshader\r\nvoid fragment()\r\n{\r\n\tvec3 v = vec3(1 == 1, true, 0);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd these cases will be forbidden:\r\n\r\n```gdshader\r\nvoid foo(float a) {\r\n}\r\n\r\nvoid fragment() {\r\n    foo(true);\r\n\tabs(true);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121512/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121512/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}